Loads a keyboard layout.

KEYB [xx[,[page][,file]]] [/ID:nnn]

  xx       The two letters of the layout: GR, FR, UK and so on.
  page     The code page. Without one, the code page in use.
  file     The file of layouts. Without one, KEYBOARD.SYS.
  /ID:nnn  Which keyboard, for a country that has two.

KEYB US loads the built-in US keyboard again.
KEYB without parameters shows the layout in use.

Ctrl+Alt+F1 switches to the US keyboard, and Ctrl+Alt+F2 back to
the layout.
